class
   Pascal.Generate.Node

inherit
   Aquarius.Trees.Program_Tree

--  Base for every generate visitor. Inheriting Program_Tree lets a visitor
--  pass Current as the Src argument to the Ast.*.Make constructors, read its
--  own token text via Concatenated_Image, and read the node properties the
--  semantic stage attached (Get_Integer_Property). The code stage keeps no
--  symbol table: name resolution and offset allocation happen in the semantic
--  stage (Pascal.Checks.*), which hands offsets off via node properties.

end
